# FDv2 State Format Update

This file documents the change from square brackets to parentheses in the FDv2 state format.

The FDv2 state (sometimes called basis) format has been updated to use parentheses () instead of square brackets [].

Example:
- Old format: `[p:17YNC7XBH88Y6RDJJ48EKPCJS7:53]`
- New format: `(p:17YNC7XBH88Y6RDJJ48EKPCJS7:53)`

This change is part of SDK-1242.
